            <ArticleTitle>Painless wakeful peribulbar block achieved safely with a single transconjunctival injection.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>200-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This single-injection, peribulbar technique provides a painless and efficacious block without the need for intravenous supplements. One hundred consecutive patients achieved lid akinesia and complete akinesia and anesthesia of the globe by the transconjunctival route. Only 1% needed a supplemental injection, and complications were minor and infrequent.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
